{
  "description": "This protocol runs the BACGene protocol for up to 96 target samples for listeria and/or salmonella pathogens. Upon upload to the Opentrons App, the user will be prompted with the volumes and positions of all labware and liquids on the OT-2 deck. Lysis buffer will automatically be prepped with enzyme addition when needed before distribution to the lysis buffer plate.",
